flowchart LR
  File[Encrypted auth record] --> Launcher[Hikyou process]
  Launcher --> CNG[Current-user CNG key]
  CNG --> TPM[TPM private-key operation]
  Launcher --> Tokens[Plaintext refresh/access tokens]
  Malware[Same-user process] -. open key / inject / read .-> Launcher
  Malware -. invoke named key .-> CNG

